  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nWhen a monster declares an attack: You can
    discard 1 card; Special Summon this card to your opponent's field. You can only
    use this effect of \"Abyss Actor - Liberty Dramatist\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster
    Effect ] \nIf this card is Special Summoned from the Pendulum Zone: The owner
    of this card reveals 3 \"Abyss Script\" Spells from their Deck, their opponent
    randomly picks 1 for this card's owner to Set on their field (but the owner destroys
    it during the End Phase), also shuffle the rest into the Deck. If this card is
    destroyed: You can shuffle 1 \"Abyss Script\" Spell from your GY into the Deck.
    You can only use each effect of \"Abyss Actor - Liberty Dramatist\" once per
    turn."
